<title>UK: Bunzl yr profit rises to 113.5 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Bunzl yr profit rises to 113.5 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		   (In million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		   16.4		vs    15.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)     6.3		vs     5.8</p>
<p> Pretax			 113.5		vs   106.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,579.7		vs 1,506.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Bunzl is a manufacturer of paper and plastics.</p>
<p>Full company name - Bunzl Plc.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
